[ceiling] The nut-slot retaining lip prints over the 8.4 mm slot width, between supported sidewalls. The opening stays accessible from the outside for inspection and nut insertion. The separate 8.4 mm roof that carries extraction load prints against the bed. The hardware witness checks this same bridge and nut fit first.
